{"version":1,"content":"<p>研究人員開發了一種人工智能模型，它不僅能通過簡單的面部照片估算生物年齡，還能識別健康風險，包括癌症患者的死亡風險。下文我們將詳細介紹這項技術的實際效果。此外，還有一個專門的研究網站供你親自體驗。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583540.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T07:03:50.483513+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":102,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T06:39:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T06:58:04.723345+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T06:58:04.723345+00:00","content_hash":"e89489146d4a9db50dfa282c5ee4d5de89694505df6ded14bf7f7a52a88dd51c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}